build/
!**/src/main/**/build/
!**/src/test/**/build/
# scripts/build/ holds the build *scripts*, not build output. The blanket build/
# rule above was swallowing it, which is why build-dbworld-backend.ps1 went
# untracked while the .bat launchers that invoke it were committed.
!scripts/build/

